<summary_text "Staff / Lead Frontend Engineer based in Amsterdam, ex-AWS, specialising in frontend platforms, React and TypeScript architecture, design systems, and engineering effectiveness. At DataSnipper, built reusable deployment infrastructure that reduced idea-to-testable-environment time to under 20 minutes. Hands-on across Node.js, CI/CD, Terraform, and cloud infrastructure, with experience defining technical strategy and leading engineers.">

